### identity health
GET http://localhost:8081/actuator/health
X-Request-Id: manual-identity-health

### identity liveness
GET http://localhost:8081/actuator/health/liveness

### identity prometheus
GET http://localhost:8081/actuator/prometheus

### P04 JWKS (public; next + active + retired keys)
GET http://localhost:8081/.well-known/jwks.json

### P04 register (Idempotency-Key required; always 202). The verification email lands in Mailpit (localhost:8025).
POST http://localhost:8081/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 0192f1e2-0000-4000-8000-000000000001
X-Request-Id: manual-register

{"email": "manual@demo.test", "password": "Correct-Horse-Battery-9", "displayName": "Manual"}

### P04 verify email (token from the Mailpit link: ...#verify=<token>)
POST http://localhost:8081/v1/auth/verify-email
Content-Type: application/json

{"token": "<token from the email>"}

### P04 login (seeded demo account; password DEMO_PASSWORD_ASHA in .env)
# @name login
POST http://localhost:8081/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "asha@demo.in", "password": "Asha-Demo-2026!", "clientId": "dexter-app", "deviceLabel": "http client"}

### P04 me (ETag)
GET http://localhost:8081/v1/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### P04 patch me (JSON Merge Patch, If-Match = the ETag)
PATCH http://localhost:8081/v1/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/merge-patch+json
If-Match: "1"

{"displayName": "Asha K", "phone": "98765 43210"}

### P04 sessions (keyset: limit, cursor)
GET http://localhost:8081/v1/me/sessions?limit=25
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### P04 refresh (rotates; presenting the old token again revokes the session)
POST http://localhost:8081/v1/auth/token/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{"refreshToken": "{{login.response.body.refreshToken}}"}

### P04 logout (this session)
POST http://localhost:8081/v1/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### P04 logout everywhere (step-up: login within 10 min)
POST http://localhost:8081/v1/auth/logout-all
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### P04 forgot password (always 202)
POST http://localhost:8081/v1/auth/password/forgot
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "asha@demo.in"}

### P04 reset password (token from the Mailpit link: ...#reset=<token>)
POST http://localhost:8081/v1/auth/password/reset
Content-Type: application/json

{"token": "<token from the email>", "newPassword": "Brand-New-Secret-42"}

### P04 change password (step-up)
POST http://localhost:8081/v1/auth/password/change
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"currentPassword": "Asha-Demo-2026!", "newPassword": "Another-Long-Secret-7"}

### P04 service token (client credentials; Basic = ledger:SERVICE_CLIENT_SECRET from .env)
POST http://localhost:8081/oauth2/token
Authorization: Basic ledger <SERVICE_CLIENT_SECRET>
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=client_credentials&audience=catalog

### P04 DEV: signing keys + forced rotation (dev profile only)
GET http://localhost:8081/_dev/p04/keys

###
POST http://localhost:8081/_dev/p04/keys/rotate
